        "hotspots-leverage-points",
        "scenarios-future-risks",
        "decision-support-outputs",
        "agrobiodiversity-crops",
        "socio-economic-livelihoods",
        "climate",
        "climate-adaptation",
        "climate-mitigation"
      ],
      "description": "Closed list used to browse and filter the catalogue. A record has one or more; the first is its primary theme. v0.1: the 13 MFL categories plus climate, adaptation and mitigation (guided by the Climate Data Hub domains)."
